#---------------------------------------------------
# 8. 本地工具配置（根据需要修改）
#---------------------------------------------------
# MATLAB 或 Keil 环境配置脚本可保留
# Scripts/setup_env.bat
# Scripts/setup_matlab_path.m



# #---------------------------------------------------
# # 1. MDK-Keil Compiler Build Output (Output Files)
# # These are generated during the build process
# #---------------------------------------------------
# *.axf         # Executable/Debug file
# *.htm         # Build log/error/info
# *.lnp         # Linker control file
# *.lst         # Listing files
# *.map         # Memory map file
# *.o           # Object files (intermediate)
# *.sct         # Scatter file (linker script)
# *.tra         # Target setting file
# *.d           # Dependency files
# *.crf         # Cross-reference file
# *.build_log.htm
# *.dep
# *.iex

# #---------------------------------------------------
# # 2. MDK-Keil Project Configuration & User Settings
# # These store user preferences, window layouts, etc.
# #---------------------------------------------------
# *.uvoptx      # Project options file
# *.uvgui* # GUI layout file (old format)
# *.uvguix.* # GUI layout file (new format)
# *.bak         # Generic backup files (may include Keil/CubeMX)

# #---------------------------------------------------
# # 3. STM32CubeMX Specific
# #---------------------------------------------------
# *.ioc-backup* # CubeMX project backup files
# # Note: CubeMX project file (.ioc) itself should generally NOT be ignored.

# #---------------------------------------------------
# # 4. Common Build Output Directories
# # These directories contain all generated output files
# #---------------------------------------------------
# /Objects/
# /Listings/
# /Output/
# /build/
# /Debug/
# /Release/

# #---------------------------------------------------
# # 5. IDE/Editor Specific Files (VSCode/Generic)
# #---------------------------------------------------
# .vscode/            # VSCode settings folder
# *.code-workspace    # VSCode workspace file